Package: ReproducibleSDOH
Title: Pre-Computed Neighborhood Socioeconomic Indices for the United States
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Rafael", "Catoia Pulgrossi", email = "rcatoiap@stanford.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Tae Yoon", "Lee", email = "harrytyl@stanford.edu", role = c("aut")))
Description: Downloads pre-computed neighborhood socioeconomic indices built
    from the US Census Bureau's American Community Survey (ACS): the Yost
    Index, the Neighborhood Deprivation Index (Messer and Powell-Wiley) and the
    Index of Concentration at the Extremes (ICE), for census tracts and block
    groups. No Census API key is needed. The files are published as releases of
    the 'ReproducibleSDOH-data' repository and are cached locally after the
    first download.
